# Accessibility

- UI should follow WCAG 2.2 AA principles.
- PDF generation must target accessible tagged PDF / PDF-UA.
- Generated PDFs must not be claimed accessible without validation.

Report validation results separately from generation.

```text
❌ BAD: "The PDF is accessible" with no validation
✅ GOOD: Target tagged PDF/PDF-UA and report validation results separately
```
